{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  APPS SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic section for rendering third-party app blocks and content
  - Acts as a container for app-specific blocks and functionality
  - Supports full-width and contained layouts via skip_container setting
  - Renders all app blocks assigned to this section
  - Integrates with Shopify app ecosystem for extended functionality
  - Used for reviews, social media, loyalty programs, and other app integrations
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN APPS CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with dynamic width and animation support
  - section-spacing: Consistent vertical spacing between sections
  - container: Default contained width (can be skipped)
  - skip_container: Boolean setting to remove container constraints
  - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
  - Responsive layout that adapts to app block content
{% endcomment %}
<div class="section-spacing {% unless section.settings.skip_container %}container{% endunless %}" data-cc-animate>
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    APP BLOCK RENDERING LOOP
    =============================================================================
    Iterates through all app blocks assigned to this section
    - section.blocks: Array of all blocks assigned to this section
    - block: Individual app block object with type and settings
    - render block: Renders the app block using its type identifier
    - Supports multiple app blocks in a single section
    - Each app block can have its own settings and functionality
  {% endcomment %}
  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {% render block %}
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for apps section customization
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - settings: Configurable options for merchants
  - skip_container: Toggle for full-width vs contained layout
  - blocks: Block types that can be added to this section
  - @app: Accepts all app blocks from installed Shopify apps
  - presets: Default section configuration for easy addition
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Apps",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "skip_container",
      "label": "Full page width",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@app"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Apps"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
